{"title":"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is called \"strong\" if there exists a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/1/1f18ce3bface8af8dde8251ea74f8b8b7410b555.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{nx} + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c36f0b157e8c2fbe0638c2f2b378e08d07695aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^n$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>a. Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/a/2fa725c98dfe19f98809033755b801810bc298aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2013$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> is strong.\n</p><p>b. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is strong, determine the smallest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> (in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />) such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/1/1e1ae8401136621281547d90b8eaaa05b3c849a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^{my} + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/9/f2949376cf9667bec6117d164f65945d8a2c049f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^m$\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>a. Take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/6/34611884711a183d1ad47e63c3398c9b30ff3147.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2^{2013}-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"18\" />, notice how <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is odd, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/e/a4eab96e66ccd3a18771f0c309cb9dd3319b3ace.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^{2013}-1)^{(2^{2013}-1)2013}+1\\equiv -1^{\\text{some odd number}}+1\\equiv -1+1\\equiv 0\\mod 2^{2013}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"584\" height=\"24\" /> so its divisible\n</p><p>b. Notice how <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is always odd as if it is even then even+odd=odd and cant be divisible by 2^m, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is always odd as if it is even <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/0/5302541b66e2704898dc837cfe1dfc4d48a008f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^{my}=(y^{ny})^2=1\\mod 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"198\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/3/003305cbe3852d43afa981e55fb47ecc4912213c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+1=0\\mod 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"16\" /> which is not true because if m=1 then it is odd. By LTE, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/7/cd7b3e9d18e9f307535d527b49e0ea3a5d5efa64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v_{2}(y^{my}+1^{my})=v_{2}(y+1)\\geq m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"248\" height=\"20\" /> as it is divisible by 2^m, and the smallest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/f/aaf73b348e79b71c35c9ed6d156a3c6346c20200.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^m-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO\">2013 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017232731\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usag